@startuml notify-2
title 用例图 2 · 通知与偏好（prd-0003 FP-2~4、prd-0004）
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
actor "订阅用户\n(已登录的消费者)" as U
actor "运营\n(内容与活动)" as Op

rectangle "发送" {
  usecase "创建通知\n选择模板与受众" as N1
  usecase "定时发送通知" as N2
}
rectangle "偏好" {
  usecase "设置接收偏好\n(渠道 / 免打扰时段)" as P1
}

Op --> N1
Op --> N2
U --> P1
N2 ..> N1 : 基于

note bottom of N1
  模板需先审核
  再用于发送
end note
note left of P1 : 默认全部开启
@enduml
